flowchart TB
    accTitle: Secure payment webhook ingress
    accDescr: Exact request bytes and allowlisted headers cross a bounded HTTP adapter, provider authentication completes before strict parsing, and only an authenticated normalized event reaches payment processing and replay protection.

    Provider[Payment provider]

    subgraph HttpBoundary[HTTP adapter]
        direction TB
        Security[Session-public and CSRF-exempt route]
        Reader[Bounded exact-byte reader]
        Headers[Allowlisted protocol headers]
    end

    subgraph Authentication[Provider authentication boundary]
        direction TB
        Registry[Verifier registry]
        Verifier[Timestamp and HMAC verifier]
        Secrets[Active and time-limited previous secret]
    end

    subgraph Application[Financial application boundary]
        direction TB
        Parser[Strict post-authentication parser]
        Event[Authenticated normalized event]
        Service[Payment webhook application service]
    end

    Reject[Uniform rejection and sanitized audit]
    Invalid[Payload-invalid response and sanitized audit]
    Replay[KAN-32 replay claim and minimal acknowledgement]

    Provider --> Security --> Reader --> Headers --> Registry --> Verifier
    Secrets --> Verifier
    Verifier -->|verified exact bytes| Parser --> Event --> Service --> Replay

    Reader -->|limit exceeded| Reject
    Registry -->|verifier unavailable| Reject
    Verifier -->|invalid signature| Reject
    Parser -->|invalid payload| Invalid

    Replay ~~~ Reject ~~~ Invalid

